# efi_registers: The EFI registers before EFI exists: writes of start, length, depth, mode and stride are stored though there is no EFI display; the mode count, selected mode and stride alignment read 0. Enabling creates it: 0x1200 reads the value written, 0x1204 the display's mode count, 0x1224 the host's alignment. A second enable keeps the display. Disabling zeroes all six stored registers.
